{"seq":2,"slug":"classification-reasoning-rule-engine","title":"归类推理规则引擎：GIR 决策树、特征项建模与相似已生效裁定检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/advance-tariff-ruling-binding-classification/application-examination-mechanism/classification-reasoning-rule-engine","wordCount":2729,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"归类推理规则引擎-gir-决策树-特征项建模与相似已生效裁定检索\">归类推理规则引擎：GIR 决策树、特征项建模与相似已生效裁定检索</h1><p>把 HS 归类做成软件功能时，工程团队最常掉进的坑是把它当成一个「编码查找表」——用户输入品名，系统输出一串数字。可真实归类里没有这样的表：全球协调制度（HS）只给到 6 位骨架，欧盟 CN、美国 HTSUS、中国税则再向下加列，而<strong>决定一个具体商品落在哪个子目的，是《解释制度的一般规则》（General Interpretative Rules，GIR，也写作 GRI）的适用顺序</strong>，不是字符串相似度。世界海关组织（WCO）的 HS 目录由 21 个类（Section）、章、品目与子目构成，配套法律注释（Section/Chapter Notes）、注释（Explanatory Notes）与归类意见（Classification Opinions）共同约束解释，现行版本为 <strong>HS 2022</strong>，下一版 <strong>HS 2028</strong> 的修订准备已在推进（<a href=\"https://www.wcotradetools.org/en/harmonized-system\">WCO 商品名称及编码协调制度</a>）。所以一个可用的归类引擎，本质是<strong>把 GIR 编译成可执行的决策树，把商品编译成结构化特征项，再拿已生效裁定做检索锚点</strong>的三段式系统。</p>\n<p>本文承接同 hub 的 <a href=\"application-dossier-preparation\">预裁定申请要件与卷宗准备</a>——那篇解决「事实如何组织进卷宗」，本文解决「组织好的事实如何被机器推理」；GIR 的法律文本与推导链结构见 <a href=\"../ruling-regime-legal-model/classification-legal-basis-gir\">归类裁定的法律基础</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>归类推理引擎要把法律推理落成可执行逻辑，关键有四点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GIR 是有序短路的判定链</strong>：六条一般解释规则按 1→6 顺序适用（GIR 3 内部再按 3a 最具体描述→3b 基本特征→3c 末位号列），前一条命中即不往后走，必须编译成带早退的决策树而非平铺 if-else。</li>\n<li><strong>事实是特征项、不是品名</strong>：引擎消费的是结构化商品特征（材质、用途、工作原理、组成部件、加工程度），品名只作线索；特征来自卷宗，缺失或冲突的特征要显式标记。</li>\n<li><strong>先例是锚点不是答案</strong>：相似已生效裁定用于检索与置信度参考，但不替代 GIR 推导；只有在事实特征一致时才增强结论。</li>\n<li><strong>可解释优先于自动率</strong>：每条结论都要能回溯到 GIR 条款、命中的节点与匹配的先例；证据不足或规则/先例分歧时必须转人工，而不是强行给码。</li>\n<li>常见误解是把引擎做成「品名相似度查表」；真正的分类依据是 GIR 顺序与特征，而非字符串匹配。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"gir-决策树-把六条规则编译成有序判定\">GIR 决策树：把六条规则编译成有序判定</h2><p>GIR 的六条规则不是并列选项，而是<strong>带短路语义的顺序执行</strong>：规则一（按品目条文与类章注释归类）先跑，只有在品目条文无法解决时才降级到规则二（未完成品/未组装件视同完整品）、规则三（混合物、成套货物、零售包装的「最具体描述」与「主要特征」判定）、规则四（最相类似）、规则五（包装容器），规则六把上述规则扩展到子目层级。工程上这直接对应一棵<strong>深度优先、带早退的判定树</strong>：每个节点是一次事实谓词求值，胜出分支立即返回并终止同级其余分支。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[结构化特征项 FactSet] --&gt; B{GIR 1 品目条文 + 类章注释&lt;br/&gt;能否唯一确定?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| Z[命中品目/子目]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C{是否未完成品/未组装件&lt;br/&gt;且已具完整品基本特征?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| Z&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D{是否混合物/成套零售包装/多部件?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[GIR 3a 最具体描述&lt;br/&gt;→ 3b 主要特征&lt;br/&gt;→ 3c 序号在后]&#10;  E --&gt; Z&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{是否与某品目最相类似?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[GIR 4]&#10;  G --&gt; Z&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[GIR 5 包装容器判定]&#10;  H --&gt; Z&#10;  Z --&gt; I[GIR 6 延伸至子目层级]\">graph TD\n  A[结构化特征项 FactSet] --&gt; B{GIR 1 品目条文 + 类章注释&lt;br/&gt;能否唯一确定?}\n  B --&gt;|是| Z[命中品目/子目]\n  B --&gt;|否| C{是否未完成品/未组装件&lt;br/&gt;且已具完整品基本特征?}\n  C --&gt;|是| Z\n  C --&gt;|否| D{是否混合物/成套零售包装/多部件?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[GIR 3a 最具体描述&lt;br/&gt;→ 3b 主要特征&lt;br/&gt;→ 3c 序号在后]\n  E --&gt; Z\n  D --&gt;|否| F{是否与某品目最相类似?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[GIR 4]\n  G --&gt; Z\n  F --&gt;|否| H[GIR 5 包装容器判定]\n  H --&gt; Z\n  Z --&gt; I[GIR 6 延伸至子目层级]</pre><p>树的实现要点有三。<strong>第一，节点必须携带法律出处</strong>：每次判定要记录它依据的是哪条 GIR 与哪条类章注释，否则推理链无法回溯——这正是预裁定审查员会追问的「你凭什么归到这里」。<strong>第二，GIR 3 内部本身是子状态机</strong>：3(a)「最具体描述」失败才轮到 3(b)「主要特征」，3(b) 失败才用 3(c)「按子目序号在后」。把这个子状态机压成一个布尔判断，是归类引擎最常见的语义错误。<strong>第三，规则顺序不可重排</strong>：先跑 GIR 3 再补 GIR 1，会得出与该批货物法律上错误的编码，因为 GIR 1 具有最高优先。</p>\n<p>判定树的规模可以用节点覆盖率来度量，给定品类集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 与规则集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Coverage</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> path</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Coverage}(S,R)=\\frac{\\left|\\{s\\in S:\\ \\exists\\,r\\in R,\\ \\text{path}(s,r)\\neq\\varnothing\\}\\right|}{|S|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Coverage</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">path</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>覆盖率低说明有大量商品在树里走到「无分支可用」的叶子——这些是必须人工兜底或扩充节点的事实形态，不是可以靠调阈值消掉的噪声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特征项建模-哪些属性真正进入判定\">特征项建模：哪些属性真正进入判定</h2><p>决策树每个节点的输入是一组<strong>特征项（feature items）</strong>。归类引擎的特征 schema 不能照搬产品目录字段（品牌、型号、售价），而要按 GIR 的推理需要反推。卷宗准备那一篇列出的八类事实是法律形态，落到引擎里要转成<strong>可比较、可缺省、可判定</strong>的结构化字段。核心特征族与它们服务的规则如下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征族</th>\n<th>典型字段</th>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>主要服务的 GIR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>材质与成分</td>\n<td>重量百分比、层结构、合金主要元素含量</td>\n<td>定量 map</td>\n<td>GIR 1、章注释（纺织/钢铁/化工）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构造与加工状态</td>\n<td>整机/散件、是否已具完整品基本特征、表面处理</td>\n<td>枚举</td>\n<td>GIR 2(a)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能与用途</td>\n<td>设计用途 vs 实际用途、是否具独立功能</td>\n<td>枚举 + 文本</td>\n<td>GIR 1、GIR 3(b)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合形态</td>\n<td>是否成套零售包装、部件清单与各部件归类</td>\n<td>布尔 + 列表</td>\n<td>GIR 3(b)、GIR 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装</td>\n<td>容器是否专用、是否与货物一同销售</td>\n<td>枚举</td>\n<td>GIR 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值规格</td>\n<td>净重、功率、容积、含糖量等品目门槛值</td>\n<td>定量</td>\n<td>品目条文的阈值判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>建模里的关键决策是**「门槛值特征」的处理**。HS 品目条文常带数值界限（如某类按重量或按功率划分），这类字段必须建成「原值 + 单位 + 是否满足阈值」的三元组，而不能只存一个布尔——因为阈值会随 HS 版本与国内税则年度修订漂移，存原值才能在版本升级时重算而不丢证据。另一类陷阱是<strong>功能字段的语义粒度</strong>：「主要用于」在 GIR 3(b) 里是判定「主要特征」的入口，但「主要」依据是功能、价值还是体积，条文并未穷尽——引擎应把该判定显式标为<strong>需人工确认的软节点</strong>，而不是让模型猜一个隐含权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相似已生效裁定检索-把先例当检索锚点\">相似已生效裁定检索：把先例当检索锚点</h2><p>GIR 决策树能覆盖有明确条文路径的商品，但真实归类有大量「边界案例」依赖解释先例。三大经济体都公开了裁定数据库：美国 CBP 的 <strong>CROSS（Customs Rulings Online Search System，<a href=\"https://rulings.cbp.gov/\">rulings.cbp.gov</a>）</strong>、欧盟的 <strong>EBTI</strong>（Binding Tariff Information 数据库，法律依据为欧盟海关法典 UCC (EU) 952/2013 第 33–37 条，BTI 有效期 3 年且 CN 编码变更即失效）、中国海关的<strong>预裁定公开目录</strong>。检索先例的价值不在于抄结论——编码会随版本漂移——而在于<strong>定位解释路径</strong>：同类商品当时走的是哪条 GIR、依据哪条注释。</p>\n<p>工程实现上是「结构化过滤 + 语义检索」的两段式。先用特征项做硬过滤（同一 4 位品目前缀、相同材质族、相同加工程度），把候选集压到可计算规模，再做向量语义匹配排序：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>d</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext>hardmatch</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(q,d)=\\lambda\\cdot\\cos\\!\\left(\\vec{v}_q,\\vec{v}_d\\right)+\\left(1-\\lambda\\right)\\cdot\\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\text{hardmatch}(f_q,f_d)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hardmatch</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是商品事实描述（材质 + 功能 + 用途文本拼接）的嵌入向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制语义与硬约束的权重。硬过滤不可省：纯向量检索会把「材质不同但描述文字很像」的商品排到前面，而材质差异在归类里往往直接改变品目。裁定文本本身是结构化数据（含编码、日期、GIR 引用、失效状态），应当解析成字段入库，而不是当纯文本检索——EBTI 与 CROSS 的裁定都带有效期与状态标记，检索时必须把已失效/被修改的先例降权或排除，否则会把过期结论当依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推理链可解释性与置信度门控\">推理链可解释性与置信度门控</h2><p>归类引擎产出编码的同时，必须产出<strong>可审计的推理链</strong>：结论 → 命中的 GIR → 依据的注释 → 支撑的事实项。这条链是预裁定申请与海关稽查复核的共同要求，也是引擎与「黑箱分类器」的分界线。审查看的是「结论在给定事实下是否唯一可推导」，而推理链正是这个可推导性的证据。</p>\n<p>置信度门控决定「何时该拒绝自动归类」。可以把置信度拆成两因子，二者的低值都应触发转人工：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>rule</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>precedent</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{accept}}=\\min\\bigl(P_{\\text{rule}},\\ P_{\\text{precedent}}\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">precedent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>rule</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{rule}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是决策树路径的确定性（路径上是否出现软节点、事实是否有缺项），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>precedent</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{precedent}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">precedent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是检索到的先例一致度（top-k 先例是否指向同一品目、是否都未失效）。<strong>只要路径经过任一软节点，或 top-k 先例指向分歧，就应落到人工队列</strong>——把这类商品硬塞进自动通道，省下的审核成本会在事后撤销、补税与争议处理上成倍付出。欧盟 UCC 第 34(5) 条把「基于不准确或不完整信息作出的 BTI」列为失效情形，本质上就是对「事实不完备却强行出结论」的法律否定。</p>\n<p>至此，归类引擎的完整形态是：<strong>GIR 决策树负责有法可依的推导，特征项建模负责把商品翻译成树可读的事实，先例检索负责补上条文未穷尽的解释边界，而置信度门控负责在证据不足时诚实地说「我不能确定」</strong>。这四者缺一，系统要么给出无法解释的编码，要么在边界案例上给出看似自信的错误答案——两者在预裁定语境下都是不可接受的失败模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>归类引擎是「GIR 决策树 + 结构化特征项 + 先例检索 + 置信度门控」的三段式系统，不是品名字符串查表。</li>\n<li>GIR 必须编译成带早退顺序的决策树（含 GIR 3a/3b/3c 子状态），先例做两段式硬过滤+语义检索并排除失效裁定。</li>\n<li>产出必须包含可回溯推理链（结论→GIR→注释→事实项），软节点或先例分歧时强制转人工，保证自动归类可解释、可审计。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"归类推理规则引擎：GIR 决策树、特征项建模与相似已生效裁定检索","id":"归类推理规则引擎-gir-决策树-特征项建模与相似已生效裁定检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GIR 决策树：把六条规则编译成有序判定","id":"gir-决策树-把六条规则编译成有序判定"},{"level":2,"text":"特征项建模：哪些属性真正进入判定","id":"特征项建模-哪些属性真正进入判定"},{"level":2,"text":"相似已生效裁定检索：把先例当检索锚点","id":"相似已生效裁定检索-把先例当检索锚点"},{"level":2,"text":"推理链可解释性与置信度门控","id":"推理链可解释性与置信度门控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预裁定申请要件与卷宗准备：产品事实、样品与归类意见的证据组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/advance-tariff-ruling-binding-classification/application-examination-mechanism/application-dossier-preparation"},"next":{"title":"审查签发流程与裁定数据模型：受理、SLA、版本受控与可复算的裁定记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/advance-tariff-ruling-binding-classification/application-examination-mechanism/review-issuance-data-model"}}